{"t":17208,"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VmjFUCStVJEqKDxgEkeAis","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# LedgerLite\n2\t\n3\tA small invoicing service. It stores invoices in a JSON file and exposes them over HTTP.\n4\t\n5\t- `src/domain/` holds money arithmetic, pricing rules and the invoice model. No I/O.\n6\t- `src/storage/` reads and writes `data/invoices.json`.\n7\t- `src/http/` is the HTTP layer: a tiny router, the handlers, and the server bootstrap.\n8\t- `src/config.ts` loads `data/config.json` and environment overrides.\n9\t- `src/cli.ts` lists and adds invoices from the command line.\n10\t\n11\tRun `npm test` for the suite, `npm run lint` for type checks, `npm start` to serve on the configured port.\n12\t\n13\tEndpoints:\n14\t\n15\t| Method | Path | Notes |\n16\t|---|---|---|\n17\t| GET | `/health` | liveness |\n18\t| GET | `/invoices?page=1&size=20` | paginated list, newest first |\n19\t| GET | `/invoices/:id` | one invoice with computed totals |\n20\t| POST | `/invoices` | create; body is `{ customer, currency, lines: [{ description, quantity, unitPriceCents }] }` |\n21\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9c74154e-77e0-49e9-bba2-61a4346e72eb","uuid":"5766b97e-8217-4872-8c3c-c1a49120f79e","timestamp":"2026-10-04T11:20:41.510Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:\\workspace\\github\\AISpec\\.worktrees\\framework\\spike\\.runs\\5-readme\\repo\\README.md","content":"# LedgerLite\n\nA small invoicing service. It stores invoices in a JSON file and exposes them over HTTP.\n\n- `src/domain/` holds money arithmetic, pricing rules and the invoice model. No I/O.\n- `src/storage/` reads and writes `data/invoices.json`.\n- `src/http/` is the HTTP layer: a tiny router, the handlers, and the server bootstrap.\n- `src/config.ts` loads `data/config.json` and environment overrides.\n- `src/cli.ts` lists and adds invoices from the command line.\n\nRun `npm test` for the suite, `npm run lint` for type checks, `npm start` to serve on the configured port.\n\nEndpoints:\n\n| Method | Path | Notes |\n|---|---|---|\n| GET | `/health` | liveness |\n| GET | `/invoices?page=1&size=20` | paginated list, newest first |\n| GET | `/invoices/:id` | one invoice with computed totals |\n| POST | `/invoices` | create; body is `{ customer, currency, lines: [{ description, quantity, unitPriceCents }] }` |\n","numLines":21,"startLine":1,"totalLines":21}}}
